async — Execute as soon as downloaded
- Downloads JavaScript while HTML is being parsed.
- Executes immediately when the download finishes.
- May interrupt HTML parsing.
- Execution order is not guaranteed for multiple scripts.

defer — Execute after HTML parsing
- Downloads JavaScript while HTML is being parsed.
- Waits until HTML parsing is complete before executing.
- Preserves the order of deferred scripts.
- Executes before the DOMContentLoaded event.


https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/